---
/*
 * One section of a Plex configuration file, built from the real default file in src/data/plex/. The page puts a
 * heading above each section. Click a setting to open what it does and what it accepts. ConfigNode.astro renders the
 * levels, and reference-tree.ts opens the setting in the URL hash.
 *
 * This follows the pattern of PaperMC's ConfigNode component (github.com/PaperMC/docs):
 * a recursive tree, <details> leaves, a path id and a "#" link on every node, and a script that
 * opens the leaf in the URL hash.
